  "description": "Meguiar’s Ultimate Insane Shine Tire & Trim Gel is an advanced, versatile formula that can be applied exactly where you want it. Apply this tire gel to your tire sidewalls for lasting protection with the durability of a month or more. Enjoy an amazing high gloss shine that will make your tires look their best. Meguiar’s tire shine gel is a unique formula that also shields against UV damage on tires and exterior plastic trim pieces. The ultra-durable, proprietary blend of high-gloss polymers resists rain and frequent washes. Not only do you get shine and protection for your tires, but it can also be applied to exterior plastic trim pieces. On either surface, you get a durable, high-gloss shine that lasts and won’t sling or run. Another benefit of this rich gel formula is that it helps eliminate overspray, runs, and drips. You get full control and a consistent, even shine. Before starting, use a tire cleaner to remove dirt and grime from your tires. When tires are cool, clean, and dry, apply an ample amount of gel to an applicator and spread evenly until the surface is covered. If too much gel is used, wipe off the excess to prevent spin-off. Keep your tires and unpainted plastic trim protected and looking great by adding Meguiar's Ultimate Insane Shine Tire & Trim Gel to your car care routine.",
